                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.102 Ic/17: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Ruddock</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-08-16T17:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 16,
                                1921—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received August 16—10:53
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>288. Your 222, August 9th, 4 p.m. Diplomatic corps desires to make warning
                    against future mutiny general and not limited Ichang. I am assenting.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ruddock</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
